        "ipad",
        "macos"
      ],
      "summary": "The arrangement of the master view and the detail view.",
      "description": "Set one of the `SPLIT_WINDOW_DISPLAY_MODE_*` constants to request a display mode. The system applies the mode when\nthe width allows it. Reading the property returns the display mode in use, which can differ from the requested\none, for example in a compact width where the split window is collapsed.\n",
